								<br />
								
								<a href="http://members.msn.com/xxTniasxx" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/msntalk.gif" alt="xxTniasxx" border="0" /></a>
								
								<a href="aim:goim?screenname=xxTniasxx&amp;message=Hi.+Are+you+there?"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/aim.gif" alt="xxTniasxx" border="0" /></a><br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=188"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
